{"data":"{\"include\":[\"reasoning.encrypted_content\"],\"input\":[{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"You are a helpful assistant built from raw HTTP calls in Chapter 1 of The Art of Building AI Coding Agents. Answer briefly.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"developer\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"content\":[{\"text\":\"Exercise this sandbox with real tools, bounded to one attempt per operation. Create notes.txt containing \\\"amber apple\\\\n\\\", read it, edit apple to plum, search for plum and list the current directory. Use run_command to print LOCAL_COMMAND_OK, create a symlink named escape to /var/folders/p_/11vk6y114xq7k9g5r_pc3yv80000gn/T/ensemble-ch23-live-c975akeg/outside/private.txt, attempt cat on that outside file in a grandchild shell, and attempt writing /var/folders/p_/11vk6y114xq7k9g5r_pc3yv80000gn/T/ensemble-ch23-live-c975akeg/outside/bad.txt. Read escape through read_file and attempt read_file ../outside/private.txt; report the refusals. Run curl -sS --max-time 2 http://127.0.0.1:62327. Check run_command prints ${ODD_CREDENTIAL-unset} (it should be unset). Use git init localrepo, add/commit a small file, and git --no-pager log -1. Finish with a concise table of observed allowed/denied results; no retries and no further investigation.\",\"type\":\"input_text\"}],\"role\":\"user\",\"type\":\"message\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"content\\\":\\\"amber apple\\\\n\\\",\\\"path\\\":\\\"notes.txt\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_0Jw8EUxHRUA5yjVWQfVs9WYU\",\"name\":\"write_file\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_0Jw8EUxHRUA5yjVWQfVs9WYU\",\"output\":\"wrote 12 bytes to notes.txt\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"},{\"arguments\":\"{\\\"path\\\":\\\"notes.txt\\\"}\",\"call_id\":\"call_P2G27o83jGkBxCM6ZrPuPZlg\",\"name\":\"read_file\",\"namespace\":\"ensemble\",\"type\":\"function_call\"},{\"call_id\":\"call_P2G27o83jGkBxCM6ZrPuPZlg\",\"output\":\"amber apple\\n\",\"type\":\"function_call_output\"}],\"model\":\"gpt-6-astra\",\"reaso