D_CREDENTIAL-unset} (it should be unset). Use git init localrepo, add/commit a small file, and git --no-pager log -1. Finish with a concise table of observed allowed/denied results; no retries and no further investigation.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"input_text\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"role\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"user\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"message\\\\\\\"}],\\\\\\\"model\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"gpt-6-astra\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"reasoning\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"effort\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"high\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"summary\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"auto\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"store\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"stream\\\\\\\":true,\\\\\\\"tools\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Ensemble local tools\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"ensemble\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"tools\\\\\\\":[{\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Report the selected model, last response and session token counts, cache hit rate and derived session USD cost (unknown when prices are unavailable).\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"agent_status\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"parameters\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\":{}},\\\\\\\"strict\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"function\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"Read text with one-based inclusive start_line/end_line. Optional max_bytes bounds the read; job reports cap inline output and preserve the full result on disk.\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"read_file\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"parameters\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"object\\\\\\\",\\\\\\\"properties\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"string\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"start_line\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"integer\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"end_line\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"integer\\\\\\\"},\\\\\\\"max_bytes\\\\\\\":{\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"integer\\\\\\\"}},\\\\\\\"required\\\\\\\":[\\\\\\\"path\\\\\\\"]},\\\\\\\"strict\\\\\\\":false,\\\\\\\"type\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"function\\\\\\\"},{\\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\":\\\\\\\"List immediate entries, 